==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|rarified}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Distant from the lives and everyday concerns of ordinary people; [[esoteric|esoteric]], [[exclusive]], [[select]].
#: ''Philosophical debates can be quite '''rarefied'''.''
# Elevated in style or nature, [[sublime]]; of high intellectual or moral value.
# {{lb|en|of a gas etc.}} Less [[dense]] than usual; [[thin]].
#: ''The air at high altitudes at the top of mountains is '''rarefied'''.''

